---
title: Adapter selection and capability boundaries
---
flowchart TD
  q1{"explicit adapter?<br/>CLI &gt; env &gt; config"}
  q1 -->|"yes"| v["validate exact choice<br/>unknown / unavailable = error<br/>no fallback"]
  q1 -->|"no"| q2{"smolvm probe<br/>binary on PATH?"}
  q2 -->|"present"| smol["smolvm<br/>experimental VM suite"]
  q2 -->|"absent"| q3{"host OS"}
  q3 -->|"Linux"| nat["native<br/>production, root required"]
  q3 -->|"macOS"| kru["krun<br/>experimental VM fallback"]

  nat --> comp["compose port suite<br/>also selectable: GKE production, Colima exp.<br/>when platform/build permits"]
  kru --> comp
  smol --> comp

  blocked["not working paths<br/>VZ boot-blocked, winbox stub<br/>not fallback targets"]
  gap["optional/no-op ports expose gaps"]

  comp -.-> blocked
  comp -.-> gap
